{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07893","headline":"登龙兴寺阁 · 孟浩然","name":"登龙兴寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁道乘空出，披轩远目开。\n逶迤见江势，客至屡缘回。\n兹郡何填委，遥山复几哉。\n苍苍皆草木，处处尽楼台。\n骤雨一阳散，行舟四海来。\n鸟归余兴远，周览更裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}